# The Docker build context is the REPO ROOT (the server image needs packages/protocol).
# Keep secrets and bulk out of it: a Pi's identity keys or tokens must never end up in an image.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/keys/
**/*.key
**/*.token
**/admin.token
**/.env
**/pifi-data/
.tmp-tests
**/*.log
